Watch out
Months are 0-based (0 = January) but days are 1-based. Date-only strings like "2024-01-15" are parsed as UTC, while "2024-01-15T10:00" (no zone) is local time. Always store and send ISO strings with Z or an offset.
Reading and doing arithmetic
