ORDER BY a.dept_id, a.emp_id, b.emp_id;
first  | second | dept_id
-------+--------+--------
Priya  | Arjun  | 2
Priya  | Neha   | 2
Arjun  | Neha   | 2
Vikram | Sara   | 3
Key point
a.emp_id < b.emp_id removes self-pairs (Priya–Priya) and mirrored duplicates (Priya–Arjun and Arjun–Priya). <> would keep both mirrors.
