A join of a table with itself using two aliases. Used for hierarchical data stored as a parent pointer (employee → manager, category → parent category), for comparing rows within the same table (pairs, duplicates, consecutive events), and for “earns more than manager”-style questions.'), 'C'),
  TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
