Examples	PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server for the app	Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift, ClickHouse, DuckDB
Storage	Row-oriented	Column-oriented, compressed
Freshness	Real time	Loaded by ETL/ELT (minutes–hours)
