HAVING AVG(e.salary) > (SELECT AVG(salary) FROM employees)
ORDER BY dept_avg DESC;
name        | dept_avg
------------+---------
Engineering | 115000.0
How do you find the full reporting chain of an employee?
A recursive CTE: anchor on the employee, then repeatedly join employees m ON m.emp_id = chain.manager_id until manager_id is NULL — see Recursive CTEs. For a fixed depth, chain self joins (e → m1 → m2).'), 'C'),
